{"text":"延昌三年八月二日，張師伯、張道夷、李始和、陳天治、□道延、形歡、□鑑景、衛車道問、胡道價、□□定州康□、蘇景問、魯國王義、王妃，合十四人等，因石窟東崖造彌勒像一區。願十四人等現世安隱，受命延長；若以命衆以後，不至三塗。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"張師伯","refId":null,"text":"張師伯","start":9,"end":12},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張道夷","refId":null,"text":"張道夷","start":13,"end":16},{"name":"PersonName","term":"李始和","refId":null,"text":"李始和","start":17,"end":20},{"name":"PersonName","term":"陳天治","refId":null,"text":"陳天治","start":21,"end":24},{"name":"PersonName","term":"形歡","refId":null,"text":"形歡","start":29,"end":31},{"name":"PersonName","term":"衛車道問","refId":null,"text":"衛車道問","start":36,"end":40},{"name":"PersonName","term":"胡道價","refId":null,"text":"胡道價","start":41,"end":44},{"name":"PersonName","term":"蘇景問","refId":null,"text":"蘇景問","start":52,"end":55},{"name":"PersonName","term":"魯國王義","refId":null,"text":"魯國王義","start":56,"end":60},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王妃","refId":null,"text":"王妃","start":61,"end":63},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":76,"end":78},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三途","refId":null,"text":"三塗","start":106,"end":108}]}